         ${python3:Depends},
         python3-numpy
Suggests: weightrail-gui
Description: local-first weight tracker command-line interface
 Weightrail records daily weights in a per-user SQLite database, displays
 records, and provides statistical and trend summaries. It does not require a
 network service or a system daemon.

Package: weightrail-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         weightrail (= ${binary:Version}),
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         python3-gi,
         python3-gi-cairo,
         python3-matplotlib
Description: local-first weight tracker GTK interface
 Weightrail records daily weights in a per-user SQLite database. This package
 adds its GTK 3 interface, including a Matplotlib history and trend chart.
